{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify landing page section called "How FlowLines Works".
    
    Section layout:
    - Full-width section with a clean white or very light cream background.
    - Add generous vertical padding, around 70px top and bottom.
    - Center the content with a max width around 1200px.
    - Add a centered headline at the top: "How FlowLines Works".
    - The headline should use a premium dark navy serif-style or bold display font.
    
    Main content:
    - Create a 3-step horizontal process layout.
    - On desktop, show three equal columns in one row.
    - Put a thin simple arrow between Step 1 and Step 2, and another arrow between Step 2 and Step 3.
    - On mobile, stack the steps vertically and remove or rotate the arrows.
    - Each step should include a large simple illustration on top, then a numbered circle, a bold step title, and a short description.
    - Keep the overall style clean, warm, beginner-friendly, premium, and easy to understand.
    
    Step 1:
    Illustration: a smartphone showing a landscape photo, with a small upload arrow icon nearby.
    Number badge: "1"
    Title: "Upload a photo or idea"
    Text: "Choose from your photos or browse our curated collections."
    
    Step 2:
    Illustration: a compact smart projector device projecting a sketch guide onto real paper.
    Number badge: "2"
    Title: "Get guided painting steps"
    Text: "FlowLines projects each step so you always know what to do."
    
    Step 3:
    Illustration: a finished landscape painting on paper, with a paintbrush and small sparkle icons.
    Number badge: "3"
    Title: "Finish your own artwork on paper"
    Text: "Paint with real brushes and paints and be proud of what you create."
    
    Design details:
    - Use dark navy for headings and number circles.
    - Use soft orange as an accent color for small highlights or sparkle icons.
    - Number badges should be dark navy circles with white numbers.
    - Text should be left-aligned within each step, but the illustrations should feel centered above each step.
    - The illustrations should be soft, clean, slightly hand-drawn, and consistent in style.
    - Avoid heavy shadows or clutter.
    - The section should clearly explain the product flow in under 5 seconds.
    
    Approximate colors:
    - Background: #FFFCF7
    - Heading color: #0B2341
    - Body text color: #2F3A4A
    - Number circle: #0B2341
    - Accent orange: #F97316
    - Arrow color: #8A8F98
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-how-it-works-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px 20px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.heading_spacing }}px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: {{ block.settings.step_gap }}px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.steps_top_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-illustration-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.illustration_size }}px;
    height: auto;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.illustration_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-number-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.number_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.number_size }}px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.number_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.number_text_color }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.number_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.number_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.title_spacing }}px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-step-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.text_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: {{ block.settings.arrow_color }};
  }

  .ai-how-it-works-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: {{ block.settings.arrow_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.arrow_size }}px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-how-it-works-steps-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_step_gap }}px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-arrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-step-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }

    .ai-how-it-works-step-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.text_size | times: 0.95 }}px;
    }
  }
